  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "It’s an ultra-deluxe tournament bracket that uses\nthe same holo-tech as Jacinthe zones.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I organized my tournament by myself, for myself!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nA delight to everyone, clearly! I trust it will stand\nas my best idea and most enjoyable event yet!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 156
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The current state of Prism Tower surely poses a\ngreat threat to Lumiose City!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What will I do to make this Lumiose City better?\nAlors, what a great responsibility I bear!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As long as Lady Jacinthe gets what she wants, all\nwill be well...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100730020006C006F006E00670020006100730020004C0061006400790020004A006100630069006E00740068006500200067006500740073002000770068006100740020007300680065002000770061006E00740073002C00200061006C006C000A00770069006C006C002000620065002000770065006C006C002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A second Super-Tournoi de Jacinthe... I’ve got no\ninterest in holding it, much less competing in it...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No matter what happens, I’ll be sure to protect\nLady Jacinthe—and everyone else—with my life!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Crossing paths with Lady Jacinthe can be a great\nburden—one that I know all too well...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Surely there is a suitable number\nof inhabitants Lumiose may have.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500720065006C0079002000740068006500720065002000690073002000610020007300750069007400610062006C00650020006E0075006D006200650072000A006F006600200069006E006800610062006900740061006E007400730020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020006D0061007900200068006100760065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In my opinion, more Pokémon\nmeans more comfort and joy.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E0020006D00790020006F00700069006E0069006F006E002C0020006D006F0072006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A006D00650061006E00730020006D006F0072006500200063006F006D0066006F0072007400200061006E00640020006A006F0079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Living cheek by jowl with Pokémon in the city\ncompels us to hone our skills as Trainers, no?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lady Jacinthe is well aware of the strength and\nabilities one needs to change a city.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s no way we can have a city that pleases all\nits various inhabitants, people and Pokémon alike.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s important to make everyone feel that even the\nimpossible is possible!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A good city is a convenient city, wouldn’t you say?\nI hope the urban redevelopment plan achieves that.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This city changed... Before I knew\nit, everything looked different.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000630069007400790020006300680061006E006700650064002E002E002E0020004200650066006F00720065002000490020006B006E00650077000A00690074002C002000650076006500720079007400680069006E00670020006C006F006F006B0065006400200064006900660066006500720065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If our guests don’t like what we serve, the hotel’s\nreputation could suffer... It’s quite nerve-racking.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s easy dealing with\npeople who are well-off.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002000650061007300790020006400650061006C0069006E006700200077006900740068000A00700065006F0070006C0065002000770068006F0020006100720065002000770065006C006C002D006F00660066002E0000",
